GOAL: check whether the human EDAR V370A allele is also found as a variant in non-human hominoids (great-apes and gibbons) and
Old-World monkey (Macaca mulatta), using population-level data (where available) and individual/reference genomes

POPULATION-LEVEL RESULTS
| Taxon                                    |            N | Result | Source                                                         |
| ---------------------------------------- | ------------ | ------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Gorilla gorilla (gorilla (wild))         |           48 | Valine | 96 chromosome copies, GAGP, individual + raw-read confirmation |
| Pan troglodytes + P. paniscus (wild)     |          214 | Valine | ~426–430 chromosome copies, GAGP, individual confirmation      |
| Pongo sp. (Sumatran + Bornean (wild))    |           25 | Valine | 50 chromosome copies, GAGP                                     |
| Macaca mulatta                           | 3,399 called | Valine | mGAP, target region callable, no target variant detected       |

